  "instructions": [
    "Soften the onion slowly in oil until it begins to color.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, and cilantro stems and cook until fragrant.",
    "Toast the cumin, paprika, and garam masala with the aromatics for one minute.",
    "Add the tomatoes and kidney beans with their liquid and bring the curry to a boil.",
    "Simmer until thick, season it, and serve the curry over rice with cilantro leaves."
